westíora profetara jatíbiainxon jakonhakanai ikaxbi jawen jemanxonbi itan jawen rarebobaonra ayamai akin jato aká iki
ea ikaibo oinnax jaskatiribi ikanwe ja kriston ikábo enribi chibanai keskáakin
ani kirikain wishaxon min bea jato bebon taxnanwe
jawe yapan xetarin bakebaon shinanyamaitian jato shinamawe neskaakin yoixon nokon yora riki joshintanishaman, enra yapa besheshokobo piai, nokon xeta riki kikin kensho
